<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF forces have intensified drone strikes, hitting a United Nations building and residential neighborhoods in Khartoum, killing four people, while a separate drone attack in Blue Nile state killed 19 civilians and displaced thousands near Ed Damazin. RSF-aligned troops assaulted aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties. A RSF counterintelligence chief and a commander defected to the Sudanese army in Khartoum, indicating shifting loyalties. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/lana-nusseibeh-uae-sudan-un-secretary-general&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNX0otQVFoNGthcWdYSXBJSGdKcXliVGVEZlM1Ukg1dDdIY25CbEY1UDJtSURLQjMweW1jMXJPOFZPVFdieDBtRGxHRTRNelRMUTJfbDB4LW5EajB4emdkcmhOX0hRbm5ZRnpRcVpNT2k5TlFvbUNPQzJ2eXVnV1dFblpOZHh4MWRkbUx0bGVvVDg3Vlpnci04QlBRLXlOUHFRR3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQNWNhM3c3WEpxa095UE53ZEF2eFVxSVZLQ2kzWlFuTzFoekNXV0p1OGJITENvbjJ6REwxMWI3VXAxUExJTXBHUzRoRGVCYnY4QzBkZ2tOQlNuTnhPQ05XN2NsNl9vZ2ZaTkJIZDNQSFB5MDRPcU1tLXJXSWQ0MHNMRDcySGV3QjVxSlloeVozUXYyRElfdW9EcVk5blZMR2ktZjdQb0tkU2x5cjI1R0lr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5yQ0szY3JZTDN6WVlxckxwdHczb1FHbGF6b3JfYmJwQVJFV1NEZHFMbkNPRU9XSmRDSnRLZi1ZbmlmU2R0amhPelJxY3JRR0xJTHRWaUNZTDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQRnpfNzZZUGVhWjh1NGFCdDJQaTlGTl9RUWdXUHFPcFg4MmNObW9PREtfaGQ3R2lrN